OL,3,GNEWSABoy who died in river 'could light
OL,4,Aup any room'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy who died when a car ended up in a
OL,7,Friver had "a personality that could
OL,8,Flight up any room", a community centre
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FSixteen-year-olds Luke Etheridge and
OL,12,FZara Shaw died along with Jackson Duke,
OL,13,F17, when the black Audi A3 they were in
OL,14,Fcame off the road at Panns Bank near
OL,15,FWearmouth Bridge, Sunderland, and
OL,16,Fplunged into the Wear just before 13:30
OL,17,FBST on Tuesday.
OL,19,FPlains Farm Youth and Community Centre,
OL,20,Fwhere Luke was a member, said he left a
OL,21,F"lasting impression" on those around
OL,22,Fhim and would be "deeply missed".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
