OL,3,GNEWSABoy who died in river 'could light
OL,4,Aup any room'
OL,5,
OL,6,FZara's former school Christ College
OL,7,Fsaid she had been "a delight to teach",
OL,8,Fwhile Hebburn Town FC, where Jackson
OL,9,Fplayed in the U18s team, said his loss
OL,10,Fwould be "deeply felt".
